This is a reconstruction of the data resources described in the LREC 2026 paper
"Persona-Aware Evaluation of Cognitive Bias in LLMs: From Benchmark to Applied
Decision-Making". The original construction data was lost; the 120 bias-benchmark
items here were re-authored to the paper's specification (see README.md) and are
not the identical strings used in the paper's experiments.
